  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "libsodium（Sodium）是基于 NaCl 的现代密码学 C 库，面向希望安全使用的开发者——核心理念是\"默认安全\"：内部自动选择最优算法、填充随机数、防御侧信道攻击，避免使用者因误选弱参数而自毁安全。全部功能通过一套扁平 C API 暴露，无外部依赖，以纯 C 编写（含可选 SIMD 汇编/内联优化路径，在构建时自动选择），能在 Windows/MinGW/MSVC（x86/x64/arm64）、Linux、macOS、iOS、Android、WASI/WebAssembly 等平台编译运行，广泛嵌入到各类应用与语言绑定库（libsodium.js、PyNaCl、lua-sodium 等集成了它的库）中。",
    "domain": "信息安全 / 密码学工具库",
    "target_users": "需要内置密码学的应用程序开发者、语言绑定库作者、网络协议实现者",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "对称加密与认证加密",
        "description": "提供秘密密钥加密（secretbox），推荐 XSalsa20-Poly1305；提供带关联数据的认证加密（AEAD：AEGIS-128L、AEGIS-256、AES256-GCM、XChaCha20-Poly1305、ChaCha20-Poly1305），防篡改且不暴露密钥",
        "evidence": [
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_secretbox.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_aead_aegis128l.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_aead_aes256gcm.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_aead_xchacha20poly1305.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "公钥加密与密钥交换",
        "description": "基于 Curve25519 的椭圆曲线 Diffie-Hellman 密钥协商（crypto_box、crypto_kx），提供密封盒子（sealed box）匿名加密；支持 X25519/Ed25519/Ristretto255 等多种曲线",
        "evidence": [
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_box.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_scalarmult_curve25519.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_kx.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_scalarmult_ristretto255.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "数字签名",
        "description": "Ed25519 椭圆曲线签名，高性能且密钥/签名短小，提供密钥生成、签名、验证及公钥转 Ed25519→Curve25519 功能",
        "evidence": [
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_sign_ed25519.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_sign.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "密码哈希与密钥派生",
        "description": "密码学哈希（BLAKE2b、SHA-2、SHA-3）；多用途短哈希 SipHash-2-4；密码哈希（Argon2id/i、scryptsalsa208sha256）抗 GPU/ASIC 暴力破解；HKDF-SHA256/512 与 BLAKE2b 密钥派生",
        "evidence": [
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_generichash_blake2b.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_hash_sha256.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_hash_sha512.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_hash_sha3.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_shorthash_siphash24.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_pwhash_argon2id.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_kdf_hkdf_sha256.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_kdf_blake2b.h"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "消息认证码（MAC）",
        "description": "一次性认证器 Poly1305 及 HMAC-SHA-256/512/512256 实现，用于消息完整性与认证",
        "evidence": [
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_onetimeauth_poly1305.h",
          "src/libsodium/include/sodium/crypto_auth_hmacsha256.h",
